SUMMARY:Tom Rhodes Comedy in the Red Bull Room
DESCRIPTION:At McNear’s in the Red Bull Room \n\n\n\nTom Rhodes\n\n\n\nThursday\, Jul 16\, 2026 \n\n\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable night of stand-up with world-traveling comedy icon Tom Rhodes\, performing live at McNear’s Saloon’s Red Bull Room in Petaluma. \n\n\n\nWith a career spanning decades\, Tom has done it all — from being one of Comedy Central’s first breakthrough stars to hosting his own talk show in Amsterdam\, and performing on Netflix\, Comedy Central\, and stages across the globe. His smart\, soulful\, and razor-sharp comedy has made him a favorite among comedy lovers worldwide. Tickets Here! 2 & 4 pack ticket bundles for discounts. \n\n\n\nThis is your chance to catch a true legend in an intimate setting — one night only! \n\n\n\nWe think standup comedy should be a cool thing that people come and enjoy\, not some cookie cutter corporate shack with no love of the art.​We are making Standup comedy cool again by producing the highest quality comedy showcases featuring comedians from Netflix\, Hulu\, Comedy Central\, HBO and more.​Grindhouse Comedy is the future Grindhouse Comedy is cool. Come see one of our Standup comedy shows in Sacramento\, Hayward or Petaluma.
URL:https://www.mcnears.com/event/tom-rhodes-comedy-in-the-red-bull-room/
LOCATION:McNear’s Red Bull Room\, 23 Petaluma Blvd N\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952\, United States
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR